#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:7
#: 684f6de1a873474db8642976e6bf6a99
msgid "The `FLIR Vue Pro <https://www.flir.com/products/vue-pro/>`__ infrared camera supports MAVLink which allows the camera to add position and attitude information to each image stored on its internal SD card"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:11
#: 61ad7450b73e48559169513b295c3a9c
msgid "The Flir Vue Pro MAVLink interface appears to be broken in the latest firmware from FLIR (ver 3.3.2) meaning pictures taken will not include EXIF data of the vehicle's position and attitude"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:16
#: 2cdc3d26cb534389af64f8ad1b6cbdac
msgid "*image courtesy of flir.com*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:18
#: 20627090454146a39514ff6992cea9e5
msgid "Some of these instructions are based on information from the `FLIR Vue Pro User Guide <https://www.flir.com/globalassets/imported-assets/document/436-0013-10-vue-pro-and-r-user-guide.pdf>`__ and `Tuffwing.com <http://www.tuffwing.com/support/Flir_Vue_Pro_Pixhawk_Installation.html>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:21
#: 71273bd53a654ffe96dfd632f3f329b2
msgid "Recommended Hardware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:23
#: c35ca7fb521d4d568f22a73dd6acc378
msgid "Flir Vue Pro is available directly from `flir.com <https://www.flir.com/products/vue-pro/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:24
#: 1856e3fa220b46afa737f626e8af864a
msgid "`Flir Cable Accessory Cable <https://www.flir.com/products/4142156_cable-accessory-port/>`__ (for Pixhawk1 using DF13 connectors) or `Tuffwing.com's Flir Vue Pro trigger and geotag cable <http://www.tuffwing.com/store/store.html#flir_vue_cable>`__ (for most other autopilots using JST connectors)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:27
#: b2e2928174b146518a3d6d3ac9c7bb59
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:33
#: 82956d6d36a84d0e9dc8027e44f29e23
msgid "Plug one end of the accessory cable into the camera's 7-pin DF13 connector (found next to the micro USB port) and then the other 6-pin connector to one of the autopilot's telemetry ports.  In this example Telem2 is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:35
#: 7af83f1b4b664f599e1779fb76c95f8d
msgid "Set the following parameters on the autopilot (assuming Telem2/Serial2 is used):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:37
#: cdb97e840e364ee886864629bea5db1c
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:38
#: 17c934f31e774dfea8df033175e1b5fe
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 57 (57200 baud)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:39
#: 804dc3b0985e4c2fbc882f1cfce03920
msgid ":ref:`MAV3_POSITION <MAV3_POSITION>` = 5 to send the vehicle's position to the camera at 5hz"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:41
#: 409cd2d0d6834f1cb6ad0f3ab67c08ae
msgid "To allow triggering the taking of pictures during a mission or from a transmitter's auxiliary switch connect the \"P3\" 3-pin servo connector to the one of the autopilot's servo outputs.  In this example AUX OUT 1 (aka SERVO9) is used.  Then set the following parameters (Assuming the Camera1 instance):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:44
#: 275730cc82cc404ba7e45e7b0660a93c
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 1 (Servo)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:45
#: 966e2b9f07fc41b4b5a1eb758bbab4bb
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_ON<CAM1_SERVO_ON>` = 1900"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:46
#: c5b138721cf04cbb98108c50437b3b7e
msgid ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = 10 (Camera Trigger)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:47
#: 9d0db85c0561477d9e7bf1bba984ea43
msgid ":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 9 (Camera Trigger) to enable triggering from transmitter switch 8"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:50
#: 6aa097f0a33c4ce88b8cafa5bf40cbac
msgid "Configure the Phone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:52
#: 88871e3233cd4344a9fd149e451f9e74
msgid "`As described on Tuffwing.com <http://www.tuffwing.com/support/Flir_Vue_Pro_Pixhawk_Installation.html>`__, install the Flir UAS app on your phone (`android <https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.flir.vuepro&hl=en>`__ or `iPhone <https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/flir-uas/id1051901140?mt=8>`__), power up the camera and connect from your phone using BlueTooth.  Set the following options for the Accessory Port:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:54
#: fd3c5d508f484fd199f1e1dd98e0f0d4
msgid "Serial Protocol: MAVLink"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:55
#: a04c8a47db3d44098d19198c9688d965
msgid "Serial Data Rate: 57600"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:56
#: 97c5c50c05c946ca8a47054ad3e7b4e8
msgid "Channel 1 : MAVLink TX"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:57
#: 6bd921f2d1704d37855eb6927581114d
msgid "Channel 3: Record Start/Stop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:60
#: 9c06b08f37ac41b3964b15a794ed9aa7
msgid "Testing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:62
#: 5b79a5c4112445a09ef0c297879f46d5
msgid "Power up the camera and autopilot in a location where the vehicle can get a GPS lock."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:63
#: 3d4ba192f5f541a29870fef2637ae001
msgid "Connect with a ground station (like Mission Planner) and check that the vehicle appears on the map"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:64
#: 0672a9370351479c97b1e4f55c9a79f4
msgid "If the serial connection between the autopilot and camera is working then shortly after the camera is powered on, it will begin sending heartbeats to the autopilot and ground station which, if using the Mission Planner, will make it appear as \"CAMERA\" in the top-right drop-down.  Selecting the CAMERA will not work though because the camera does not respond to requests for parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:69
#: c0ce6e0234fb4215b5c79c2137982c26
msgid "Trigger taking a picture using the transmitter's auxiliary switch or by right-mouse-button-clicking on the map and selecting \"Trigger Camera NOW\".  The camera should beep"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:70
#: 1cb98e41fb114b85979a460a108e9a87
msgid "Connect the camera to your computer using a USB cable (or remove the camera's SD card) and check that an image has been captured"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:71
#: 5eeae86691d348619a4d1b5678365f04
msgid "Check the file properties to ensure the latitude, longitude and altitude have been recorded with the image"
msgstr ""
